Package: openjdk-21-jdk-awt
Name: OpenJDK 21 AWT/X11 Development Kit
Version: 21.0.12+ios2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-awt (= 21.0.12+ios2)
Provides: java-compiler, java-sdk
Description: OpenJDK 21 development tools for the AWT/X11 runtime on iOS.
 Adds javac, jar, javadoc, jlink, JShell, debugger and diagnostic tools,
 headers, JMODs, manuals, and OpenJDK sources to the headful Java runtime.
 .
 Installs alongside, not over, openjdk-21-jdk-headless: these tools live in
 the java-21-openjdk-awt directory and claim no /usr/bin names. Select them
 with JAVA_HOME.
Maintainer: max
Author: OpenJDK contributors and Xios
Section: Development
Priority: optional
MinimumOSVersion: 16.0
